  "objects": [
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-1",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 28,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "操作說明 · 全工具指南",
      "fontSize": 32
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-2",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 90,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 200,
      "zIndex": 1,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "工具列預設為「圖示與文字」，常用分頁預先包含筆刷與線條樣式；可在自訂工具列調整。首次使用會加入「操作說明 · 全工具指南」無邊界筆記，涵蓋全部工具及可編輯範例。用中鍵拖曳／空白鍵加拖曳平移，滾輪縮放，開圖釘清單可跳到各章。舊範例與已編輯作品不會被覆寫；修改或刪除新指南後不會每次重建。 「清除本頁」預設收在常用；更新時只追加這一項，保留其他自訂常用。一般畫布與螢幕畫布的圖形選單使用相同描邊圖示與九宮格。 選取與雷射固定顯示於所有分頁外，雷射預設納入常用但不重複一顆按鈕；再次點雷射開啟設定。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-3",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 302,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 260,
      "zIndex": 2,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "01 介面與手冊語言 · 02 開始使用 · 03 首頁與作品庫 · 04 畫布格式與頁面 · 05 平移、縮放與視角鎖定 · 06 導覽與工具列 · 07 畫筆與筆刷 · 08 線段、箭頭、形狀與曲線 · 09 選取與物件變形 · 10 屬性、色彩與樣式 · 11 文字與便條紙 · 12 橡皮擦 · 13 尺規 · 14 圓規：準備、鎖定、畫弧 · 15 雷射筆 · 16 計算機與計時器 · 17 圖片、截圖與裁切 · 18 圖釘與配色 · 19 螢幕畫布 · 20 保存、資料與匯出 · 21 快捷鍵速查 · 22 程式更新 · 23 功能範圍與已知限制 · 24 背景設定操作要點 · 25 圖層順序與操作回饋",
      "fontSize": 16
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-4",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 630,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 3,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "01 · 介面與手冊語言",
      "fontSize": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-5",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 692,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 110,
      "zIndex": 4,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "首頁側欄下方「語言」（收合時為文/A圖示）提供正體中文（預設）、簡體中文、英文、日文、韓文、西班牙文、法文、德文、葡萄牙文（巴西）、阿拉伯文。保存成功立即套用，下次啟動沿用。既有作品名稱與文字不翻譯，新建的預設名稱採當時語言。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-6",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 814,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 110,
      "zIndex": 5,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "使用說明隨目前介面語言開啟；本頁語言選單只切換手冊，不改程式偏好。全部手冊、章節與搜尋均可離線使用。阿拉伯文介面與手冊從右向左閱讀，畫布座標不鏡像。系統選檔與原始錯誤訊息可能使用其他語言，部分內建控制項可能需重新啟動。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-7",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 992,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 6,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "02 · 開始使用",
      "fontSize": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-8",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1054,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "zIndex": 7,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "首頁按＋新增，選筆記本、無邊界畫布或有邊界黑板，輸入名稱並設定背景色與樣式。畫筆用來手寫，選取工具（V）用來移動及調整物件。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-9",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1146,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "zIndex": 8,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "自動存檔預設關閉。Ctrl+S可手動保存，離開作品或正常退出也會保存。匯出.heiban可作為可編輯備份。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-10",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1294,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 9,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "03 · 首頁與作品庫",
      "fontSize": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-11",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1356,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "zIndex": 10,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "單擊卡片只反白，不顯示批次操作列；雙擊或右鍵「開啟作品」進入。右鍵亦可收藏、改名、副本與移到垃圾桶。垃圾桶保留原稿，雙擊垃圾桶卡片可還原。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-12",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1448,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 230,
      "zIndex": 11,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "按匯入旁虛線圓進入多選，圓圈打勾表示已選；可全選目前結果或逐張選取，再移到垃圾桶，「完成」離開多選。可搜尋名稱、篩選格式、依修改／建立／名稱排序及選160／190／250 pt縮圖。匯入支援.heiban／.blackboard.json；側欄切換全部、收藏與垃圾桶。 工具列預設為「圖示與文字」，常用分頁預先包含筆刷與線條樣式；可在自訂工具列調整。首次使用會加入「操作說明 · 全工具指南」無邊界筆記，涵蓋全部工具及可編輯範例。用中鍵拖曳／空白鍵加拖曳平移，滾輪縮放，開圖釘清單可跳到各章。舊範例與已編輯作品不會被覆寫；修改或刪除新指南後不會每次重建。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-13",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1746,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 12,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "04 · 畫布格式與頁面",
      "fontSize": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-14",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1808,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "zIndex": 13,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "筆記本各頁獨立，底部頁碼與左右箭頭翻頁，＋新增頁；頁碼選單可跳頁、改名、副本、排序及刪頁。無邊界畫布可向任意方向延伸。有邊界黑板提供固定紙張邊界，適合簡報與排版。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-15",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1900,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 110,
      "zIndex": 14,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "無邊界不顯示尺寸。新有邊界黑板首次預設16:9簡報（1920×1080），仍可改A4直向、A4橫向或1:1；切換格式記住此對話框已選尺寸。新增與畫布背景提供空白、橫線、點狀、方格、五線譜及底色；既有作品按套用才修改，取消保留，修改可單步復原。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-16",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2078,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
