      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 0.45,
      "isLocked": false,
      "points": "[{\"x\": 710, \"y\": 3676}, {\"x\": 850, \"y\": 3676}]"
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-34",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3924,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 33,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "08 · 線段、箭頭、形狀與曲線",
      "fontSize": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-35",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3986,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 34,
      "strokeColor": "#57816c",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "圖形 · 曲線 · 磁鐵",
      "fontSize": 17
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-36",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4048,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "zIndex": 35,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "線段／箭頭拖曳或先點A再點B建立，線身整體移動、兩端獨立調整。屬性可選線段、向A／B或雙向延伸而不改原端點；箭頭頭部長寬獨立，線條粗細也調整頭部輪廓。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-37",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4140,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 110,
      "zIndex": 36,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "矩形、圓、菱形、五角與星形拖曳建立；三角／四邊形逐點，曲線三點：第一點預覽、第二點固定彎曲、第三點提交。選取可調頂點／控制點，Esc取消未完成幾何。色圓與屬性調整適用的線色、填色、漸層與透明度。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-38",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4262,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 230,
      "zIndex": 37,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "完成後保留原繪圖工具，三角／四邊形逐頂點預覽直線，曲線才預覽曲線。圓、菱形、五角與星形從中心開始拖曳，矩形從角開始。磁鐵從第一個點就作用，靠近約 10 個畫面 DIP 時顯示綠圈並吸附；矩形有四角、四邊中點及中心共九點；三角形有三頂點與三邊中點；其他多邊形也含各邊中點，直線／箭頭有端點與中點。圓與圓規圓弧含中心及上下左右點，圓弧另含起訖點。隱藏物件不參與，鎖定形狀仍能參考，原物件不會被移動。 磁鐵只吸附幾何工具的建構點與圓規定位；畫筆、螢光筆、油漆筆保留原始手繪軌跡，跨越舊筆跡不吸附。一般畫布與螢幕畫布一致；尺規投影及停筆一秒直線辨識仍依各自規則作用。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-39",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "rect",
      "x": 70,
      "y": 4528,
      "width": 170,
      "height": 110,
      "zIndex": 38,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "#dcebdd",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false
    },
